 "titulo": "You built a street over a water pipe 🕳️ #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "THE ROAD FELL IN",
 "descripcion": "A leaking pipe can empty the ground under a perfect-looking street. In September 2025 a burst pipe helped open a pit about 50 meters deep on a Bangkok street. Here is how cities stop it.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #sinkhole #bangkok #howitworks #shorts",
